## STEPS

p: These are the basic steps to success that will reveal the truth behind #TheTrentonStory and make you a #HERO to #Humanity for your selfless service.

### 1 - DUMMIES

make: Make a FOR-DUMMIES edition of the #TheTrentonStory of your questions, tests, and results.
p:The dummies versions would be as if #YOU were explained #TheTrentonStory to a 12 year old. It should be something easy to understand, and share.

### 2 - MESSAGES

p: Develop Information Messages from previous the #DUMMIES version. The options below are possible locations to seed your #MESSAGES.

videos: Leave comments, replies, and chats on #QuinnMichaels Youtube videos
blogs: Writing Blog entries and comments about #TheTrentonStory
x: Craft Posts and devise a schedule with your #FINDINGS.
instagram: Craft Instagram Posts/Stories to keep a clean #TIMELINE
